{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mush Dash</i> is an online party racing game for up to 7 players where adorable mushrooms sprint, jump and explode their way through deadly obstacle courses to avoid becoming dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a58f49d66a3856fd8960d521a45e4e3b.avif?t=1763139206\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is made up of 3 \u201cwaves\u201d. At the start of the game, 3 stages are randomly chosen from 5 waves in the selected theme. Survive the traps, reach the goal and grab as many Mushroom Coins as you can along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/2e66a261f8d39543a10693ad4ff4fd7c.avif?t=1763139206\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing first is great, but it\u2019s not everything. Your final rank is decided by both your position at the finish line <strong>and</strong> the Mushroom Coins you\u2019ve collected, so a clever route or a risky shortcut can flip the results at the last second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/a44544573108ad3f9916e3e2bbae6a8f.avif?t=1763139206\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 7\u2011player online races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random 3\u2011wave matches for fresh runs every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, moving platforms and other nasty traps that require pattern reading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushroom Coins that can steal victory even if you don\u2019t finish first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense rounds that are perfect for voice chat and party play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you keep your mushroom out of the cooking pot and become the champion of <i>Mush Dash</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/extras/e2fc5e5e75cce43f538d3240a8a4b01c.avif?t=1763139206\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3153140?t=1763139206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/af16e9605ce9e2c81d62bf68d88b349bfc9d8ae7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763139206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/5b4046ddd502d7dc2abec101c77944b59768fef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763139206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153140/5b4046ddd502d7dc2abec101c77944b59768fef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763139206","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mush Dash</i> is an online party racing game for up to 7 players where adorable mushrooms sprint, jump and explode their way through deadly obstacle courses to avoid becoming dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a